spans.s:
vṛddhi,
(1) (undeclined form!), in phrase: diṣṭyā vṛddhi (cf. Skt. diṣṭyā vardhase), congratulations! (regularly to a king): mahārāja di˚ vṛ˚ Mv 〔ii.113.5〕; deva di˚ (mss. dṛṣṭvā) vṛddhi devasya putro jātaḥ Divy 〔405.20〕; deva di˚ (mss. dṛṣṭvā) vṛ˚ Divy 〔425.2〕. Cf. also jaya-vuddhi, s.v. vuddhi;
(2) n. of one of the eight deities of the bodhitree: LV 〔331.21〕 (˚dhiḥ).
